{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09227","headline":"荅重阳 · 韦应物","name":"荅重阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"省札陈往事，怆忆数年中。\n一身朝北阙，家累守田农。\n望山亦临水，暇日每来同。\n性情一疎散，园林多清风。\n忽复隔淮海，梦想在沣东。\n病来经时节，起见秋塘空。\n城郭连榛岭，鸟雀噪沟丛。\n坐使惊霜鬓，撩乱已如蓬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09227.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09227","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}